OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start with overnight
OL,6,Frain clearing the south of the region.
OL,7,FTurning partly cloudy through the
OL,8,Fmorning with showers developing widely
OL,9,Fbut heaviest over the Pennines and
OL,10,FMoors. Feeling cooler in fresh
OL,11,Fnorthwest winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers become restricted to
OL,14,Fnorthwestern areas with many areas
OL,15,Fturning partly cloudy and dry through
OL,16,Fthe evening. Cloud building again by
OL,17,Fdawn but remaining mostly dry. Cooler
OL,18,Fovernight than recently.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
