OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FMostly cloudy but dry to
OL,6,Fstart, patchy light rain develops
OL,7,Fthrough the morning, turning more
OL,8,Fpersistent for a time during the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Fresh southwest winds. Near
OL,10,Faverage temperatures.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FFresh
OL,13,Fwinds but drier and brighter on
OL,14,FSaturday and Sunday, although an
OL,15,Fisolated shower can't be ruled out.
OL,16,FCloudier into Monday with some light
OL,17,Frain at times. Temperatures around
OL,18,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
